# A Mojo package, built by mopm's unit graph. Planned: the mopm that buildrules pins is a stand-in until mopm's first release, so this leg is skipped
# (and says so) while rules/mopm/pins.bzl marks it release_pending. These steps have not been run end to end yet.
planned-until mopm-release
run buildrules init . --git {origin} --commit {commit}
config
run buildrules mojo sync
run buildrules mojo check
# //hello:lib is the package's .mojoc: a file, so the build-twice check compares bytes. //hello:ci alone is a group with no output (the check would compare nothing; tools/stage refuses such a leg).
build //hello:ci //hello:lib
